flowchart TB
  U[User / Browser] --> FE[Web Frontend]
  FE --> API[FastAPI Gateway]
  API --> AUTH[Optional API Key Gate]
  AUTH --> CHAT[Chat Router]
  AUTH --> DOC[Document Router]
  AUTH --> MEM[Memory Router]
  AUTH --> AG[Agent Router]
  CHAT --> ORCH[Context Assembly]
  ORCH --> RET[Knowledge Retrieval]
  ORCH --> MRET[Memory Retrieval]
  ORCH --> LLM[LLM Provider Adapter]
  LLM --> OLLAMA[Ollama]
  LLM --> GEM[Gemini API]
  LLM --> OLL[Local Ollama]
  LLM --> MOCK[Mock Provider]
  DOC --> PARSE[Text / PDF Parser]
  PARSE --> CHUNK[Chunking]
  CHUNK --> SQLITE[(SQLite)]
  RET --> SQLITE
  MEM --> SQLITE
  AG --> WORKER[Bounded Specialist Worker]
  WORKER --> RET
  WORKER --> LLM
  subgraph Research Model
    DATA[Curated Dataset] --> TOK[Byte Tokenizer]
    TOK --> TRAIN[PyTorch Training]
    TRAIN --> CKPT[Model Checkpoint]
  end
